        "id": 1333748
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-22T04:04:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`ish_enabled` here can be uninitialized, we set it on line 57 only if we\u0027re running on the EC. This means that this init function will break the ISH behavior. I suggest initializing the `ish_enabled \u003d ISH_ENABLED` this way on the ISH this will clearly be correct and on the EC it will only be correct if `cros_cbi_get_fw_config` returned that it\u0027s true.",
      "revId": "cf3e4ffebcac8507592b5586df6b02ec5c6591f2",
